#: {{syn|en|get out of here|Thesaurus:bullshit}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=Amir Abrams|title=Diva Rules|publisher=Dafina Books|year=2015|page=151|isbn=978-0-7582-9480-7|passage=“Okay, busted. But you see all them muscles, girl?” She shakes her head, laughing. “Nope. I only have eyes for my boo.” “Girl, '''bye'''. You can still look.” She giggles. “Well, I ain’t lookin’ hard, trust.{{nb...}}”}}
#* {{RQ:NYPost|author=Susan Edelman|author2=C.J. Sullivan|author3=Bruce Golding|title=Trump supporter's sign gets torched|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20221205182200/https://nypost.com/2016/08/07/mans-trump-sign-goes-up-in-flames/|date=7 August 2016|passage=Rowlings-Blake responded: "Girl '''bye''', if he can't take criticism from 'a joke', what's he gonna do when somebody real comes for him? #notready"}}
#* {{RQ:Twitter|en|date=18 February 2021|handle=mi55fatima|id=1362546190903111683|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230720204451/https://twitter.com/mi55fatima/status/1362546190903111683|archivedate=20 July 2023|passage=Her jeans don't even got the loops for her damn belt LMFAO '''bye''' 😭}}
#* {{RQ:Twitter|en|date=20 December 2021|handle=kplightning|id=1472984691573764108|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230720204449/https://twitter.com/kplightning/status/1472984691573764108|archivedate=20 July 2023|passage="i wish to get back a couple of katycats that left my side" '''bye''' did she really say this..its so sad i love her sm 😢😔}}
#* {{RQ:Twitter|en|date=11 July 2023|handle=KimcastCares|id=1678831478770135057|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230720204450/https://twitter.com/KimcastCares/status/1678831478770135057|archivedate=20 July 2023|passage="I just want Johnny to leave me alone." Girl, '''bye'''. Control your lap dog.}}

